19-08-02T21:40:12Z","closed_at":"2019-08-02T21:40:12Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"While manually flushing tables through `yb-admin`, I noticed that metrics like `rocksdb_total_sst_file_size` do not update real-time for tserver (works on master). I have to manually run `yb-ctl restart` to get the metrics to update.\r\n\r\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n\r\n1. `bin/yb-ctl start`\r\n2. `java -jar target/yb-sample-apps.jar --workload CassandraKeyValue --nodes 127.0.0.1:9042`\r\n3. Checking tserver metrics at `localhost:9000/metrics` shows `rocksdb_total_sst_file_size` is 0. Master on the other hand is updated at `localhost:7000/tablet-servers` and `localhost:7000/metrics`.\r\n4. `build/latest/bin/yb-admin flush_table ybdemo_keyspace cassandrakeyvalue`\r\n5. `localhost:9000/metrics` is still not updated.\r\n6. `bin/yb-ctl restart`\r\n7. `localhost:9000/metrics` is updated.","closed_by":{"login":"ttyusupov","id":903044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzA0NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/903044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov","html_url":"https://github.com/ttyusupov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttyusupov/received_events","type":"Us